# ==============================================================================
# MOMENTUM ENVIRONMENT CONFIGURATION GUIDE
# ==============================================================================
# IMPORTANT SECURITY POLICY:
# Do NOT prefix private AI provider keys with EXPO_PUBLIC_!
# EXPO_PUBLIC_* variables are embedded in the mobile application binary and
# can be extracted by anyone decompiling the APK or inspecting client traffic.
#
# Production Architecture:
# - Client uses ONLY EXPO_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL and EXPO_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY.
# - Private AI keys (NVIDIA, OpenRouter, Gemini, Bytez) are configured securely
#   on the server-side as Supabase Edge Function secrets.
# ==============================================================================

# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 1. CLIENT APPLICATION ENVIRONMENT (Mobile Client Bundle)
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Required for mobile client to connect to Supabase backend & invoke Edge Functions:
EXPO_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL=https://your-supabase-project.supabase.co
EXPO_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=your-supabase-publishable-anon-key

# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 2. SERVER-SIDE SECRETS (Supabase Edge Functions / Backend / Local Dev Server)
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Set these using Supabase CLI:
#   supabase secrets set NVIDIA_API_KEY=nvapi-...
#   supabase secrets set OPENROUTER_API_KEY=sk-or-v1-...
#   supabase secrets set GEMINI_API_KEY=...
#   supabase secrets set BYTEZ_API_KEY=...
#
# Or in your local supabase/.env for local edge function testing:

# Primary Provider: NVIDIA NIM (https://integrate.api.nvidia.com/v1)
NVIDIA_API_KEY=nvapi-your-key-here
NVIDIA_MODEL=nvidia/nemotron-3.5-super-vl-120b-a12b

# Secondary Fallback: OpenRouter (https://openrouter.ai)
OPENROUTER_API_KEY=sk-or-v1-your-key-here
OPENROUTER_MODEL=cohere/north-mini-code:free

# Tertiary Fallback: Google Gemini API (https://aistudio.google.com)
GEMINI_API_KEY=your-gemini-key-here
GEMINI_MODEL=gemini-flash-lite-latest

# Quaternary Fallback: Bytez AI (https://bytez.com)
BYTEZ_API_KEY=your-bytez-key-here
BYTEZ_MODEL=Qwen/Qwen2.5-7B-Instruct
